Subject: [PATCH 2/2] refactor: extract rule-proposal confirmation handling
 (0.10.339)

Second extraction from UnifiedMCPAgent._process_user_request. Pulls the
rule-authoring proposal confirmation block (evaluate ConfirmationPolicy
for proposed hub_manage_rule_machine writes, queue them, build the
response message) into rule_proposal_confirmation.py's
RuleProposalConfirmation, matching the constructor-injected-dependencies
shape already used by ConfirmedActionCoordinator and DirectOutcomeContext.

No behavior change. mcp_agent_orchestrator.py: 999 -> 980 lines (1,026
before the 0.10.338 catalog-assembly extraction).

Rebased onto origin/main after upstream's own 0.10.335-0.10.337 releases;
renumbered to 0.10.339 to avoid the collision, same as 0.10.338 before it.
